# Enter with only the dash, or only spaces, adds nothing and the panel stays open saying "Type the text".
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
keys qi <Enter>
see Type the text
keys <Space> <Space> <Space>
keys <Enter>
see Type the text
see Quick Add → INBOX
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
